# Analytics (src/app/analytics.ts). The PostHog project API key starts with phc_. It is public by
# design (it can only send events, never read them), so it lives here in the repo. Empty = analytics off.
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=
# https://us.i.posthog.com for a US Cloud project, https://eu.i.posthog.com for an EU one.
VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
